G4616.def:
**σινδών**, -όνος, ἡ
[in LXX: [[Jdg.14.12-13|Jdg.14:12-13]] A, [[Pro.31.24|Pro.31:24]] (סָדִין), [[1Ma.10.64|1Ma.10:64]] A * ;]
**fine linen cloth**;
(a) **as used for swathing dead bodies **(cf. Hdt., ii, 86): [[Mat.27.59|Mat.27:59]], [[Mrk.15.46|Mrk.15:46]], [[Luk.23.53|Luk.23:53]];
(b) **a garment or wrap of this material **(cf. _ICC_, Jg, l.with): [[Mrk.14.51-52|Mrk.14:51-52]]†
(AS)

G4691.def:
**σπερμολόγος**, -ον
(σπέρμα, λέγω)
**a seed picker**;
(a) prop., of birds (Arist., Aristoph, al.);
(b) in Attic slang, of **an idler** who lives on scraps picked up in the agora; hence, as subst., ὁ σ., **an idle babbler**: [[Act.17.18|Act.17:18]]†
(AS)
